        "2307.03917_rag::chunk_007"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "The encoder component is treated as the generator of GAN"^^xsd:string,
        "The encoder component is treated as the generator of GAN and is trained to produc"^^xsd:string,
        "The encoder is comprised of a stacked bidirectional recurrent neural network (RNN) [20, 21] that reads acoustic features x = ( x 1 , . . . , x K ) and outputs a sequence of high-level features (hidden states) h = ( h 1 , . . . , h K )."^^xsd:string,
        "effectively imbued the seq-to-seq encoder with a far-eld front-end"^^xsd:string,
        "inducing invariance at the encoder embedding level considerably improves the recognition of simulated far-eld speech by vanilla seq-to-seq models."^^xsd:string,
        "retraining the last layers of the Audio2Vec (skip-gram) encoder."^^xsd:string,
        "the input layer of the encoder sometimes receives phoneme and phoneme stress embeddings"^^xsd:string,
        "the structure of the convolutional 2D encoder contains 2 convolutional layers"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:skos_definition "A component of a speech recognition model, often treated as a generator in GAN frameworks, that produces embeddings."^^xsd:string ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom "CQ_S0_R1_0025"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0066"^^xsd:string,
