        "2309.03199_rag::chunk_008"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Table 2: Word Error Rates (WERs) on the LibriSpeech subsets test clean and test other."^^xsd:string,
        "The de facto standard metric to evaluate the performance of ASR systems is Word Error Rate (WER)"^^xsd:string,
        "The de facto standard metric to evaluate the performance of ASR systems is Word Error Rate (WER) or Word Accuracy Rate (WAR)."^^xsd:string,
        "decreases the word error rates on Googles Voice Search and Long-tail Maps datasets"^^xsd:string,
        "evaluating the word error rate (WER) when applying the Whisper medium [ 37 ] ASR system to the results"^^xsd:string,
