    kg:textSpan "and validating our models. We use the original 16 KHz sampling rate. The vocabulary L contains 30 graphemes: the standard English alphabet plus the apostrophe, silence, and two special repetition graphemes which encode the duplication (once or twice) of the previous letter (see Section 2.3). The architecture hyper-parameters, as well the decoder ones were tuned using the validation set. In the following, we either report letter-error-rates (LERs) or word-error-rates (WERs). WERs have been obtain" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1609_03499_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
