    kg:textSpan "the case for image pixel intensities or audio sample values). One of the reasons is that a categorical distribution is more exible and can more easily model arbitrary distributions because it makes no assumptions about their shape. Because raw audio is typically stored as a sequence of 16-bit integer values (one per timestep), a softmax layer would need to output 65,536 probabilities per timestep to model all possible values. To make this more tractable, we rst apply a -law companding transforma" .

