    kg:textSpan "sees one frame (each of which has size FS ) at a time while the faster clock-rate component(sample-level component) sees one acoustic sample at a time i.e. the ratio of clock-rates for these two modules would be the size of a single frame. Number of sequential steps for frame-level component would be FS times lower. We repeat the output of each step of frame-level component FS times so that number of time-steps for output of both the components match. The output of both these modules are concate" .

