    kg:textSpan "the cepstral domain. Deep learning-based front-end techniques are normally designed in a supervised manner. For a better review, we set the input of a learning model as y that is the representation extracted from noisy speech, and the target as x . Based on how the training target x is obtained, the techniques can be categorised into i) mapping-based methods, where x is the representation, straightforwardly extracted from clean speech, 5 TABLE I G ENERAL DESCRIPTION OF SOME STANDARD EVALUATION C" .

