    kg:textSpan "CTC helps to speed up the process of estimating the desired alignment. The objective to be maximized is a logarithmic linear combination of the CTC and attention objectives, i.e., p ctc ( C | X ) in Eq. (1) and p att ( C | X ) in Eq. (4): p ( z t | X ) = Softmax ( Lin ( h t )) (2) h t = BLSTM ( X ) . (3) Softmax ( ) is a softmax activation function, and Lin ( ) is a linear layer to convert hidden vector h t to a ( |U| +1) dimensional vector ( +1 means a blank symbol introduced in CTC). Although " .

