    kg:textSpan "and is a hyperparameter that weights the contribution of the penalty relative to the loss. 4. Experiments 4.1. Datasets 3.2. Dynamic Layer Normalization We evaluate our proposed methods on two benchmark datasets for large vocabulary automatic speech recognition experiments: the Wall Street Journal (WSJ) corpus [18] and TED-LIUM corpus release 2 [19]. The WSJ corpus primarily consists of read speech with texts drawn from a machine-readable corpus of Wall Street Journal news text. The TED-LIUM cor" .

