    kg:textSpan "conditioning the joint model on the language ID, there is no confusion between languages. What does the conditioned model output for mismatched language ID? The interesting question here is does the model obey acoustics or is it faithful to the language ID. To answer this, we created an articial dataset of about 1,000 Urdu utterances labeled with the Hindi language ID and transcribed it with the encoderconditioned model. As it turns out, the model is extremely faithful to the language ID and sti" .

