    kg:textSpan "face model on average. Besides, it need an additional 0.52ms to extract audio feature for each audio window. As is illustrated above, the other deployments in the framework do not need extra time in the inference process. Therefore, the average time for the feature extraction and a forward pass of our neural network for one audio window is 0.68ms, which makes it possible for the implementation of real-time animation. v u u t 1 n X = n We can gure out from Table 1 that our approach consistently a" .

