    kg:textSpan "The ResNet-34 based systems in [18] use the TAP, SAP, and LDE layer, respectively. The ResNet-34 based system in [20] applies L 2 -constraint based deep length normalization. The proposed system uses the SPE layer and A-softmax loss with ring loss. We obtain an EER of 4.03%, a DCF 10 2 6. Results 6.1. Comparison of pooling methods [TABLE id=1906.08333_p4_t2] caption: Table 2 compares the performance of different pooling methods. columns: pooling | eer | dcf_10_2 row: DCF 10 3 TAP; pooling=4.62; " .

