    kg:textSpan "is not well-explained by the conditioning inputs: the text representation, speaker, and language embeddings. We follow the structure from [12], except we use a standard single Gaussian prior distribution and reduce the latent dimension to 16. In our experiments, we observe that feeding in the prior mean (all zeros) during inference, signicantly improves stability of cross-lingual speaker transfer and leads to improved naturalness as shown by MOS evaluations in Section 3.4. 2.1. Input representat" .

