    kg:textSpan "we combined the Parallel WaveGAN with the Transformer-based parameter estimator [1517]. To train the Transformer, we used the phoneme sequences as input and mel-spectrograms extracted from the recorded speech as output. The model consisted of a six-layer encoder and a sixlayer decoder, each was based on multi-head attention (with eight heads). The conguration followed the prior work [17], but the model was modied to accept accent as an external input for pitch accent language (e.g., Japanese) [3" .

