    kg:textSpan "NoiseVC: Towards High Quality Zero-Shot Voice Conversion Shijun Wang 1 , Damian Borth 1 1 University of St.Gallen, Switzerland shijun.wang@unisg.ch, damian.borth@unisg.ch Abstract [15, 16] for zero-shot conversion, such idea has been used in the disentanglement task in computer vision domain. In [17, 18], a Text-to-Speech model is introduced to supervise the training of latent representations of a VC system. However, these models either lack adequate disentanglement ability or need assistance fr" .

