    kg:textSpan "to auto-regressive models like Tacotron 2 [3]. The TalkNet inference is 132 times faster than real-time with batch size 1, and 2531 times faster for batch size 32. We propose a new neural TTS model to address these three challenges. The model consists of three convolutional networks. The rst network predicts grapheme durations. The explicit duration predictor replaces attention-based alignment to prevent word skipping and repeating. Next we expand an input text based on the grapheme predicted du" .

