    kg:textSpan "Multi-Task Learning for End-to-End ASR Word and Utterance Condence with Deletion Prediction David Qiu 1 , Yanzhang He 1 , Qiujia Li 2 , Yu Zhang 1 , Liangliang Cao 1 , Ian McGraw 1 1 Google, LLC, USA, 2 University of Cambridge, UK 1 { qdavid, yanzhanghe, ngyuzh, llcao, imcgraw } @google.com, 2 ql264@cam.ac.uk Abstract addressed. Utterance-level condence scores are also important for applications such as data selection [4, 6, 7]. One can directly average the word-level condence scores for utteran" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2104_12870_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
