    kg:textSpan "the styles in target speakers. AdaSpeech [ 40 ] designs acoustic condition modeling to better model the acoustic conditions such as recording devices, environment noise, accents, speaker rates, speaker timbre, etc. In this way, the model tends to generalize instead of memorizing the acoustic conditions, and can be well adapted to the speech data with different acoustic conditions. AdaSpeech 3 [ 404 ] adapts a reading-style TTS model to spontaneous style, by designing specic lled pauses adaptatio" .

