    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2106_15561_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "longer text length, different text domains, etc. Improving the generalizability of the TTS model to different domains is critical for robust synthesis. Expressive/controllable/transferrable speech synthesis . The expressiveness, controllability and transferability of TTS models rely on better variation information modeling. Existing methods leverage reference encoder or explicit prosody features (e.g., pitch, duration, energy) for variation modeling, which enjoys good controllability and transfe" .

