    kg:textSpan "StarGANv2-VC: A Diverse, Unsupervised, Non-parallel Framework for Natural-Sounding Voice Conversion Yinghao Aaron Li, Ali Zare, Nima Mesgarani Department of Electrical Engineering, Columbia University, USA yl4579@columbia.edu, az2584@columbia.edu, nima@ee.columbia.edu Abstract bels, which are not often available at hand. Here, we present a new method for unsupervised nonparallel many-to-many voice conversion using recently proposed GAN architecture for image style transfer, StarGAN v2 [10]. Our " .

