    kg:textSpan "order to convert soft alignments ( A soft ) to hard alignments ( A hard ). We further close the gap between soft and hard alignments by forcing A soft to match A hard as much as possible by minimizing their KL-divergence. This is used in both Glow-TTS and RAD-TTS, formulated as L bin : L bin = A hard log A soft , (10) Tacotron 2 100 Tacotron 2 + prior Tacotron 2 + prior + L align 50 5000 10000 15000 20000 150 Flowtron (single-ow) Flowtron + prior 100 Flowtron + prior + L align 50 0 10000 20000 3" .

