    kg:textSpan "A grow quadratically O ( n 2 ) with sequence length n , while the operations in the rest of the network have a linear complexity relationship with n [1,5,8]. In short, reducing the sequence length would have a large impact on the computational complexity of these models. 2.2. Patchout Motivated by (a) the impact of reducing the sequence length on the computation complexity of training transformer models; (b) the fact that audio events are expected to be spread out in time and frequency in an aud" .

