    kg:textSpan "to new speakers, as illustrated in Fig. 1. Algorithm 1 Large-scale Pre-training and Meta Learning Input : Large-scale multi-speaker and multi-prosody TTS corpus D ; Learning rate and Output : Meta model M We denote a pair of text and mel spectrogram as ( X, Y ) . During large-scale pre-training phase, parameters of MetaVoice are initialized as 0 = { 0 , s 0 , p 0 } and optimized to minimize a reconstruction loss between a predicted mel spectrogram Y and the ground-truth Y , as well as the domain" .

