    kg:textSpan "Meta-Voice, for voice cloning. The MAML algorithm is adopted to accelerate the adaptation process. Domain adversarial training mechanism and orthogonal constraint are adopted to disentangle speaker and prosody representations for effective cross-speaker style transfer. Experimental results have shown that Meta-Voice can achieve speaker cosine similarity of 0.7 within 100 adaptation steps for both cross-gender and intra-gender style transfer settings. Future directions include investigating the u" .

