    kg:textSpan "input for the vocoder and for the ow-based decoder, thus, no intermediate representation (such as mel-spectrograms) is necessary. This allows the model to learn an intermediate representation; hence, it achieves superior results to a two-stage approach system in which the vocoder and the TTS model are trained separately [19]. Furthermore, to enable our model to synthesize speech with diverse rhythms from the input text, we use the stochastic duration predictor proposed in [19]. YourTTS during tr" .

