    kg:textSpan "recognition [4]. We train wav2vec-U 2.0 [5], an ASR model that does not require paired speech and text data, to obtain pseudo-speech-to-text annotation. To build speech synthesize systems as the second step, we follow the same learning paradigm as existing supervised TTS models [6], but use machine-annotated speech instead of human-annotated data. In our experiments, we demonstrate the effectiveness of the simple method. We show that synthesizing intelligible and natural speech is possible witho" .

