    kg:textSpan "found that reducing the kernel sizes can greatly reduce the synthesis speed. Furthermore, we excluded the additional CNNs following the dilated CNNs. Notably, feeding the output of the nal QP-ResBlock to the lter-network through downsampling CNNs is essential for the high-frequency reproduction in the output voice. We show the details and the importance by an ablation study in Section Section 4. ( E t d if E t > 1 1 d else , (3) d t = where E t = F s / ( f t a ) is a proportional value to the pe" .

