    kg:textSpan "we attempt to use natural language as a style prompt to control the styles in the synthetic speech, e.g. , Sigh tone in full of sad mood with some helpless feeling. Considering that there is no existing TTS corpus that is suitable to benchmark this novel task, we first construct a speech corpus whose speech samples are annotated with not only content transcriptions but also style descriptions in natural language. Then we propose an expressive TTS model, named InstructTTS, which is novel in the s" .

