    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1703_07754_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "layer mapped 640 dimensions to the vocabulary size+1 (for the blank symbol). Our rst training attempt used uniformly-random weight initialization over ( 0 . 01 , 0 . 01) similar to the phone CTC model. However, the training failed to converge as shown 2.3. Phone CTC Model We trained our phone CTC system over 44 phones from the Switchboard pronunciation lexicon [2] plus the blank symbol. We extracted 40-dimensional logMel lterbank energies over 25 ms frames every 10 ms from the input speech signa" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1705_02304_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "1705.02304_rag::chunk_001" ;
    kg:docId "1705.02304_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1705_02304_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "the same minibatch. This approach provides faster training convergence. Finally, we evaluate our proposed Deep Speaker system on three different datasets, for text-independent and text-dependent speaker We present Deep Speaker, a neural speaker embedding system that maps utterances to a hypersphere where speaker similarity is measured by cosine similarity. The embeddings generated by Deep Speaker can be used for many tasks, including speaker identication, verication, and clustering. We experimen" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1705_02304_rag__chunk_007> a kg:Chunk ;
