    kg:docId "1705.02304_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1705_02304_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "the test set. Deep Speaker models are trained with different neural network architectures (GRU or ResCNN), and different strategies (softmax, triplet loss, or softmax + triplet loss, which is softmax pretraining followed by triplet loss ne-tuning). The results are listed in Table 5. All Deep Speaker models achieve notable improvements over the baseline, roughly 50 80% relative reduction on EER, and 60 70% relative improvement on ACC. MTurk contains scripted English utterances collected on Amazon" .

