    kg:docId "1707.07167_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1707_07167_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "the beam width. In Fig. 4, we can see that attention smoothing achieves the best performance when = 2 and there is no additional benets when we further increase the temperature. We see the same observation on the validation set as well. Meanwhile, we investigated the effect of adding language model. During decoding, with the help of a trigram LM that was trained using 4M voice search entries, further gains can be observed. Finally, attention smoothing + trigram LM achieved the lowest CER of 2.81" .

