    kg:textSpan "al. ( 2017 ). A fully-connected layer is applied to the context vector to generate the output of the attention block. Overall, positional encodings improve the convolutional attention mechanism. Production-quality TTS systems have very low tolerance for attention errors. Hence, besides positional encodings, we consider additional strategies to eliminate the cases of repeating or skipping words. One approach is to substitute the canonical attention mechanism with the monotonic attention mechanism" .

