    kg:textSpan "convolution 1D kernel size. The overall number of model parameters is 222.5M. We add more detailed model configurations in Appendix A.1. Training and inference. In the training stage, we train Mega-TTS on 8 NVIDIA A100 GPUs, with a batch size of 30 sentences on each GPU. We use the Adam optimizer with 1 = 0 . 9 , 2 = 0 . 98 , = 10 9 and follow the same learning rate schedule in [ 56 ]. It takes 320k steps for the VQ-GAN TTS models training and 100K steps for the P-LLMs training until convergence" .

