    kg:textSpan "interpolation. 4 E XPERIMENTS 4.1 E XPERIMENTAL SETUP Training Datasets. We train Mega-TTS 2 and all baselines on LibriLight (Kahn et al., 2020), which contains 60K hours of unlabelled speech derived from LibriVox audiobooks. The sample rate is 16KHz for all speech data. We transcribe the speech with the hybrid DNN-HMM ASR model pre-trained on 960 hours labeled LibriSpeech following VALL-E (Wang et al., 2023). We align the phoneme sequence with speech using the external alignment tool (McAuliffe" .

