    kg:textSpan "in the CT-DNN structure require less training data; (2) the major restriction on performance of the d-vector system is not the model training, but the simple average back-end. In the C(30- 3) condition where the test utterances are short, the impact of feature average is less signicant, and so the true quality of the learned feature is exhibited, leading to a clear performance improvement when more training data are used. In other conditions, however, the improvement obtained by the big data tra" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1705_09422_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
