    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1710_10467_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "in a similar, but not identical domain. We want to train a single model that performs well on dataset D 1 , with the help from D 2 : 3.1. Text-Dependent Speaker Verication Though existing voice assistants usually only support a single keyword, studies show that users prefer that multiple keywords are supported at the same time. For multi-user on Google Home, two keywords are supported simultaneously: OK Google and Hey Google. Enabling speaker verication on multiple keywords falls between TD-SV a" .

