    kg:textSpan "SPEAKER DIARIZATION WITH LSTM Quan Wang 1 Carlton Downey 2 Li Wan 1 Philip Andrew Manseld 1 Ignacio Lopez Moreno 1 1 Google Inc., USA 2 Carnegie Mellon University, USA 1 { quanw , liwan , memes , elnota } @google.com 2 cmdowney@cs.cmu.edu ABSTRACT keywords [ 12 , 13 ]. In contrast, speaker diarization requires textindependent embeddings which work on arbitrary speech. In this paper, we explore a text-independent d-vector based approach to speaker diarization. We leverage the work of [ 11 ] to tr" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1710_10468_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
