    kg:textSpan "MULTILINGUAL SPEECH RECOGNITION WITH A SINGLE END-TO-END MODEL Shubham Toshniwal Tara N. Sainath, Ron J. Weiss, Bo Li, Pedro Moreno, Eugene Weinstein, Kanishka Rao Toyota Technological Institute at Chicago shtoshni@ttic.edu Google Inc., U.S.A { tsainath, ronw, boboli, pedro, weinstein, kanishkarao } @google.com arXiv:1711.01694v2 [eess.AS] 15 Feb 2018 ABSTRACT or DNN-based systems [16]. These multilingual AMs still require language-specic pronunciation models (PMs) and language models (LMs) whic" .

