    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2106_15561_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "on neural TTS mainly from the perspective of basic TTS components: text analysis, acoustic models, vocoders 6 , and fully end-to-end models, as shown in Figure 3a. We nd this taxonomy is consistent with the data conversion ow from text to waveform: 1) Text analysis converts character into phoneme or linguistic features; 2) Acoustic models generate acoustic features, from either linguistic features or characters/phonemes; 3) Vocoders generate waveform from either linguistic features or acoustic f" .

