    kg:textSpan "that of the recording [19], while the quality of the mel-spectrogram generated by acoustic model still has gap to recording due to the difculty of prosody modeling. Intuitively speaking, vocoder only need to recover phase information given ground-truth spectrogram, while acoustic model needs to close the large gap between text and spectrogram, such as duration, pitch, formant, voiced/unvoiced part, prosody, etc. When increasing the sampling rate to 48 kHz, the burden of acoustic model is further" .

